entries.description:
Forces animation of bay to given state, -1 for reset to engine handling, can cause weapon inoperative, because weapon is released when bay state == 1.

> **Note:** While there is no getter to read the animation phase of the given bay, the animationPhase command can be used with the individual bay door name from animationNames as a workaround (See #Example 3
).

