player addAction ["Heal self", { player setDamage 0; }];
// ...
removeAllActions player;
```

Do

```sqf
player addAction ["Heal self (once)", {
	params ["_target", "", "_actionId"];
	_target setDamage 0;
	_target removeAction _actionId;
}];
```

Don't

```sqf
player addAction ["Heal self (once)", {
	player setDamage 0;
	removeAllActions player;
}];
```

