entries.description:
Triggered when a script error occurs. See also the `[-showScriptErrors`](Arma 3: Startup Parameters#Developer Options) [startup parameter](Arma 3: Startup Parameters).

> **Note:** Event Handlers have a recursion check. Most of them have a level limit set to **1**;
**ScriptError** has it set to **2** - meaning that an error occuring inside the Event Handler will trigger once more the EH, but no more than two times total.

